  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> is incident on a single slit of width <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"w\"></span>. A diffraction pattern is formed on the screen where the angle between the central maximum and the first minimum is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. Which of the following combinations of changes to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"w\"></span> will cause the greatest increase in <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Change to </strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathbf{f}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Change to </strong><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathbf{w}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3f\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{w}{3}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3f\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3w\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{3}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{w}{3}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{3}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3w\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
